[node name="StoryItems" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="LampPegs" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-300, -150)
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the lamp pegs"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The lamp pegs[/b]

A row of wooden pegs by the hearth, where the miners hang their lamps when they come up off shift. Every peg has a name burned into it.

Four pegs at the end are painted black and nothing hangs on them. Nobody at the counter will sit beneath them, and nobody will take them down."
reexamine_text = "Four black pegs. Nothing hangs on them."

