[node name="ShiftBoard" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(430, -150)
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the shift board"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The shift board[/b]

A plank chalked with the week's shifts, first, second and night, and the levels they work: FOURTH, FIFTH, SIXTH. The column for the seventh has been ruled off and left empty.

Underneath, someone has chalked: ALE ON CREDIT TILL THE GUILD PAYS. Someone else has added: IF."
reexamine_text = "The seventh level column is still empty."

