[node name="DustyCups" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(190, -20)
script = ExtResource("7_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the cups"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Grey cups[/b]

Every cup on the counter is the colour of the hill. The dust comes in on the miners' boots and sleeves and settles on everything, and the keeper has long since stopped wiping it off.

The ale is dark, strong and two copper. Miners drink it like water."
reexamine_text = "The cups are as grey as ever."

